@startuml
title La Nonna - topologia de microservicios configurada
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Visitante / Cliente / Admin" as user
node "Host Docker\nunico puerto publicado: 4000" as host {
  node "Red privada Docker\ninternal: true" as private {
    node "gateway :4100\npublicado al host" as gateway {
      component "API Gateway REST\nallowlist + rate limit" as api
      component "Frontend estático" as frontend
    }
    node "auth :4101" as auth
    node "clients :4102" as clients
    node "inventory :4103" as inventory
    node "orders :4104" as orders
    node "payments :4105" as payments
    node "reservations :4106" as reservations
    node "graphql :4107\nprivado" as graphql
  }
  database "auth_data\nusuarios/sesiones" as authDb
  database "clients_data\nperfiles" as clientsDb
  database "inventory_data\nproductos/stock" as inventoryDb
  database "orders_data\npedidos/líneas" as ordersDb
  database "payments_data\npagos/eventos" as paymentsDb
  database "reservations_data\nreservas" as reservationsDb
}

user --> api : HTTP/HTTPS
api --> frontend : HTML/CSS/JS
api --> auth : login / introspección\nHTTP privado
api --> clients : perfiles
api --> inventory : catálogo / administración
api --> orders : pedidos
api --> payments : pagos / webhook
api --> reservations : reservas
api --> graphql : consulta agregada
graphql --> inventory : catálogo REST interno
graphql --> orders : pedidos REST interno
clients --> auth : crear identidad
orders --> inventory : reservar/liberar stock
payments --> orders : validar / confirmar
auth --> authDb
clients --> clientsDb
inventory --> inventoryDb
orders --> ordersDb
payments --> paymentsDb
reservations --> reservationsDb

note bottom of host
Compose declara seis bases/volúmenes independientes y red privada.
Solo Gateway tiene ports; Docker no estuvo disponible para ejecutar/validar
esta topología durante la revisión.
end note
note bottom of payments
Webpay es una simulación académica. Payments valida el webhook HMAC,
timestamp y event_id; no hay integración financiera oficial.
end note
@enduml
